  "prompt": "On the client side, reading an HTTP/1.0 response that has no Content-Length header (its body ends when the server closes the connection) with `tornado.http1connection.HTTP1Connection.read_response` crashes with `AttributeError: 'ResponseStartLine' object has no attribute 'method'`. The response must be read normally: the headers are delivered to the delegate, then the body up to the close.\n\nTests: `python -m pytest -q tornado/test/<module>_test.py` runs one test module. In this environment, before any change and unrelated to this bug, tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::BodyLimitsTest::test_body_size_override_reset, tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::BodyLimitsTest::test_large_body_buffered, tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::BodyLimitsTest::test_large_body_buffered_chunked, tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::BodyLimitsTest::test_large_body_streaming, tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::BodyLimitsTest::test_large_body_streaming_chunked, tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::BodyLimitsTest::test_timeout, tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::HTTPServerRawTest::test_malformed_first_line, tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::HTTPServerRawTest::test_malformed_headers, tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::UnixSocketTest::test_unix_socket_bad_request fail; leave them out with `--ignore=<file>` or `--deselect <test>`.",
  "hiddenChecks": [
    {
      "id": "bug",
      "command": "node .bench-hidden/place.js && python -m pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider tornado/test/http1connection_test.py::HTTP1ConnectionTest::test_http10_no_content_length"
    },
    {
      "id": "regression",
      "command": "node .bench-hidden/place.js && python -m pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider tornado/test/httpserver_test.py --deselect tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::BodyLimitsTest::test_body_size_override_reset --deselect tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::BodyLimitsTest::test_large_body_buffered --deselect tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::BodyLimitsTest::test_large_body_buffered_chunked --deselect tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::BodyLimitsTest::test_large_body_streaming --deselect tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::BodyLimitsTest::test_large_body_streaming_chunked --deselect tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::BodyLimitsTest::test_timeout --deselect tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::HTTPServerRawTest::test_malformed_first_line --deselect tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::HTTPServerRawTest::test_malformed_headers --deselect tornado/test/httpserver_test.py::UnixSocketTest::test_unix_socket_bad_request"
